### Smart CRM – manual API checks (VS Code "REST Client" or JetBrains HTTP Client)
### Fill in @password with DEMO_PASSWORD from .env. Ticket 9 = BH-000009/2026 (DA_PHAN_CONG, KT008, center TT01).

@base = http://localhost:8000
@password = doi-mat-khau-demo

### 1. Log in as manager QL_TT01
# @name managerLogin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "QL_TT01", "password": "{{password}}"}

###
@manager = {{managerLogin.response.body.access_token}}

### 2. New tickets of my center
GET {{base}}/api/tickets?status=MOI
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### 3. TC-07 (a): wrong phone -> 400 INVALID_PHONE
POST {{base}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_name": "Nguyễn Văn An", "customer_phone": "09123", "serial_no": "SN10293A",
 "issue_desc": "Máy không lên nguồn", "category_code": "PIN", "priority": "CAO",
 "due_date": "2027-01-15T17:00:00+07:00"}

### 4. TC-07 (b) / BUG-08: blank required fields -> 400 REQUIRED_FIELD_BLANK
POST {{base}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_name": "   ", "customer_phone": "0912345678", "serial_no": "   ",
 "issue_desc": "   ", "category_code": "PIN", "priority": "CAO",
 "due_date": "2027-01-15T17:00:00+07:00"}

### 5. Suggestions for ticket 9
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/9/technician-suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### 6. TC-06: change technician with a blank reason -> 400 REASON_REQUIRED
PUT {{base}}/api/tickets/9/assignment
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"technician_id": 12, "reason": "   "}

### 7. Book an appointment (choose a free Monday–Saturday slot in the future)
POST {{base}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ticket_id": 9, "appointment_type": "NHAN",
 "start_at": "2027-01-12T09:00:00+07:00", "end_at": "2027-01-12T10:00:00+07:00"}

### 8. TC-08: unknown ticket -> 404 TICKET_NOT_FOUND
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/99999999
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### 9. TC-11 (a): injection in a filter -> 400 INVALID_STATUS
GET {{base}}/api/tickets?status=' OR 1=1 --
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### 10. TC-10 (a): no token -> 401
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me

### 11. Log in as technician KT002
# @name techLogin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "KT002", "password": "{{password}}"}

###
@tech = {{techLogin.response.body.access_token}}

### 12. TC-09 (a): KT002 changes KT008's ticket -> 403 FORBIDDEN
PATCH {{base}}/api/tickets/9/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tech}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"to_status": "DANG_XU_LY"}

### 13. My tickets (phone numbers masked)
GET {{base}}/api/technicians/me/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{tech}}
